 "description": "過去最高気温50℃、年間降水量わずか200mm。そんな砂漠にアメリカ第5位の大都市が存在する。古代ホホカム族の運河から始まるフェニックス500万都市圏の謎に迫る。\n\n参考記事\n\nCity of Phoenix History\nhttps://www.phoenix.gov/administration/departments/communications/history-facts/city-history.html#putting-a-stamp-on-phoenix-history-(video-series)\n\n2024 Heat-Related Deaths Report\nhttps://www.maricopa.gov/ArchiveCenter/ViewFile/Item/5934\n\nA history of canals in Arizona\nhttps://www.srpnet.com/about/history/canal-history\n\nHOHOKAM IRRIGATION CANALS\nhttps://tile.loc.gov/storage-services/master/pnp/habshaer/az/az0600/az0627/data/az0627data.pdf\n\nTheodore Roosevelt Dam and Lake\nhttps://www.srpnet.com/grid-water-management/water-management/lakes/theodore-roosevelt-dam-lake\n\nCentral Arizona Project\nhttps://www.usbr.gov/projects/index.php?id=504\n\nComprehensive Housing Market Analysis Phoenix-Mesa-Chandler, Arizona\nhttps://www.huduser.gov/portal/publications/pdf/PhoenixMesaChandlerAZ-CHMA-25.pdf\n\nThe MAG Region in Review\nhttps://azmag.gov/portals/0/About-MAG/MAG-Region-in-Review-Report.pdf\n\nResident Population in Phoenix-Mesa-Scottsdale, AZ (MSA) (PHXPOP)\nhttps://fred.stlouisfed.org/series/PHXPOP\n\nResponding to Drought in the Colorado River Basin\nhttps://crsreports.congress.gov/product/pdf/IN/IN11982/20\n\nHohokam Legacy: Desert Canals\nhttps://www.waterhistory.org/histories/hohokam2/\n\nSouth Phoenix Water History\nhttps://gatherandgrowaz.org/south-phoenix-water-history/\n\nHISTORY OF WATER IN THE VALLEY: BECOMING ONE OF THE FIRST FIVE\nhttps://wateruseitwisely.com/blog/salt-river-project-history/\n\nNASA Earth Observatory (2016) – 「Sun City, Arizona」\nhttps://science.nasa.gov/earth/earth-observatory/sun-city-arizona-89363/\n\nVitalyst Health Report (Geo-demographics of Aging in AZ, 2003)\nhttps://vitalysthealth.org/wp-content/uploads/2014/02/CoA_Geo-demographics_of_Aging.pdf\n\nNALC Postal Record (2014年3月号)\nhttps://www.nalc.org/news/the-postal-record/2014/march-2014/document/03-2014_retired.pdf\n\nASU W.P. Carey “